body:
Close functions should be blocking.  I.e. they should not return until all goroutines they are in charge of stopping have exited.

One way to do that dance:

```go
type FWCP struct {
	stop chan struct{}
	done chan struct{}
}

func (FWCP) run() {
	defer close(p.done)
	..
	for {
		select {
		case <-p.stop:
	...
}

func (FWCP) Close() {
	close(p.stop)
	<-p.done
}
```

